sidewall charge through the forward knee: ramp to 0.3 V, charge on a 1 nF series capacitor
load "spice/diode.osdi"
load "spice/capacitor.osdi"
model vs vsource
model c sp_capacitor
model dm sp_diode is=1e-20 cjo=0 cjsw=10p php=0.8 mjsw=0.33 fcs=0.5
v1 (s 0) vs type="pwl" wave=[0, 0, 1u, 0.3, 2u, 0.3]
c0 (s a) c c=1n
d1 (a 0) dm pj=1
control
  options rawfile="ascii" reltol=1e-9
  analysis tr1 tran stop=2u step=1n maxstep=1n
endc
